# SuperTuxKart's profile race, its benchmark, with the arguments of Linux's
# reference runs on the Lenovo (tools/lenovo/debian-ref/games.sh): four AI
# karts on the hacienda track for 90 s of the race's own time from seed 1,
# after which the game ends itself and prints its profile summary. Words
# separated by blanks, read by tests/graphics/runners/games.sh, which adds
# the fullscreen size.
--profile-time=90
--track=hacienda
--numkarts=4
--seed=1
